# Eudoxus credentials. Entirely optional: without them the Eudoxus checker
# reads the public announcement feed and skips the authenticated pages.
#
#     ./bin/uoa-credentials.sh store eudoxus
#
# Same plain fallback format as uoa-mail-creds.example, read from
# ~/.eudoxus-creds. chmod 600 it if you use it.
#
# Line 1: username
# Line 2: password
YOUR_USERNAME
YOUR_PASSWORD
